  {
   "id": "vanishing-starlight-395337@0.1.003",
   "gameId": "vanishing-starlight-395337",
   "displayName": "Update 0.1.003",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-02-07T14:23:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1.武技界面中增加“空中受身”技能说明，玩家在被击飞后可以按“跳跃”键快速恢复平衡，此操作会消耗一个行动点数",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.调整武技“伐天怒潮”释放效果，玩家可以在释放过程中调整方向",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.增加多个武技的“扫地”判定，可以攻击到倒地敌人",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4.缩短敌人倒地起身时间",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5.调整BOSS应泷技能“横向激光炮”，增加提示预警",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6.调整BOSS应泷部分技能的伤害范围",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
